    category:text(ccb.content.text("a blue portal with a mouse's head sticking out.  The mouse is pointing some kind of gun-like device towards a cube made of Swiss cheese.  The back of the shirt has an orange portal, with the back half of the mouse entering the portal."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a drawing of a ceiling with a round hole in it.  A quizzical-looking Cthulhu pokes its head down through the hole."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a jack-o'-lantern with a tiny smiling black bat popping out of the top."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a woman standing in front of a yawning portal, with numerous cats exiting the portal and surrounding her."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a giant blocky robot with a cone-shaped head.  It holds both arms out, carrying a cyclops woman with purple hair."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a peasant with a fist raised, eyes alight with the fire of freedom, proclaiming, 'Down with sword-based governments!'"))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of an old-fashioned cartoon black goat on the front, above the goat it says 'Black Phillip' and below are the words 'Live Deliciously'."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a stylized castle with five spires.  Each spire has a purple-gray flame at the top.  At the bottom of the castle it says 'Menzoberranzan'"))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a hooded child standing behind a lectern, his mouth open and his arms held high.  A pentagram has been carved into the lectern and stuffed animals are arranged in a semicircle facing the child.  On the left of the child are the words 'Let's Start A Cult', while below it reads 'Activities for Children'."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a circle of stars.  Inside the circle is a blue and yellow skeleton with his arms raised and mouth open.  Above the skeleton are the words 'Make Eternia' and below him, 'Great Again'."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a drawing of a Nazgûl riding a black horse.  The drawing is in the style of old My Little Pony cartoons."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a pixelated cleaning robot, wielding a cattle prod and wearing a little blue beret.  The big blue lettering above it reads: \"HAVE A SECURE DAY!\""))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a stereotypical tourist, clad in obnoxious Hawaiian print and trudging through a torchlit dungeon.  In one hand, he holds a disposable camera, and in the other, the severed head of a gorgon."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a drawing of a banjo-playing frog, sitting on a wheel of cheese with a wedge taken out.  The text above it reads: \"The Lovers, The Dreamers, and Cheese!\""))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a graphic of 3 colorful baboons standing on a cliff and howling at a crescent moon.  The top text reads: \"HATED BY BABOONS FOR QUESTIONING\", and the bottom text reads \"THE ORIGINS OF THE MOON\"."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of two cyborgs wearing red robes, pondering a toaster."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a simple graphic of the 'March of Progress' model of human evolution.  At the front of the line, the human is being choked by a robot."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a red-eyed gingerbread man, holding a candy cane to its mouth.  Stylized to look like smoke, the text above it reads \"Baked like a gingerbread man\"."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of two young women doing their nails, sitting on the back of a classic muscle car.  A human hand dangles limply from the trunk.  The tagline, \"Some girls just wanna have fun\", is written in blood-red cursive across the top."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of an old man wearing a fez, wielding a high-powered sniper rifle.  It is drawn in the style of a popular cartoon."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a drawing of a zombie holding a sign.  The sign reads \"This is a sign you should contribute!\" You not entirely sure what they are referencing."))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a corkboard, with red, yellow, and pink strings connecting various photographs.  Each photo shows someone of a different race, profession, and/or gender identity.  The strings spell out the acronym \"LCS\""))
    category:text(ccb.content.text("a picture of a dwarven mine, cutaway for viewing pleasure.  At the very bottom of the twisting tunnels filled with dwarves performing various tasks, there is a large lake of lava.  And just below that lake is a giant circus tent."))
    ccb.content.add(category)
end

