    category:entry {
        id = "note_151",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Gonna settle down one day.  Nice big orchard, couple of friends/future family to spend time with, and a nice system of fortifications to keep us safe.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_152",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"a ctulaly don t mi nd  t he cold it   s  f i ne in h ere  nn    o problem\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_154",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Tried wearing dead zombie clothes, but they still knew I was alive!  It's like they're a hivemind, man!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_155",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"riddle.  what's 1/4 feathers, 1/4 scales, 1/4 metal, and 1/4 flesh?  answer: sorry, but you should know this one.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_156",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"For anyone that's reading this, I just want to confirm (FROM AN UNBIASED SOURCE) that it was NOT the scientists' fault.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_157",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"We're the eagle-eyes in the sky!  Just two mutant avians in our helicopter!  Filming the Cataclysm!  Check us out on any working electronics!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_158",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"WE'RE GOING TO SAIL TO CANADA, BITCHES!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_159",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Anyone hear about that guy who tried to sail his family to Canada?  What a moron, right?\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_160",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"recently canadian border has gotten more dangerous don't go there\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_161",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Hey, what happened to my dad's airboat?!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_162",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Reading is good!  Never stop reading.  Read EVERYTHING.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_163",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I'm gonna be honest here, I'm really gonna die soon so I dont want to gt forgnottedn ples dont forntget me y nrmmy name is h@@hbhbh\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_164",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"all it takes to seal a wound is a sawblade and a match!  trust me\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_165",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I wonder what's in this sarcophagus?  Maybe it's a real sarcophagus.  Maybe there's a big guy named God under here.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_166",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"these hulks aint so incredible when ya got .50\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_167",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nobody left on the radio.  Might as well throw this thing away…\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_168",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I've heard it's safer across the Mississippi.  Going to start driving today.  If you're reading this, pray for me\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_170",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"We have Landed our Comet.  The Sky is Ablaze.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_171",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Last one standing.  It's good feeling.  I win.  I win I win I win I win I win\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_172",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Adderall cures weakness, tramadol cures death\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_173",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"These turrets keep dodging my FUCKING BULLETS!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_174",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Best way to train is by throwing pebbles at birds.  You'll be a legend.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_175",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"new bedford is overrun.  i'm sorry.  we tried.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_176",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages out of some of those assholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_177",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Renting out my rat tunnels for 50 9mm rounds a night.  I dug them with my own claws, so you know they're the best.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_178",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Anyone wanna listen to some music at full volume and shoot the Zs that approach?  You pick the tunes if I get some ammo.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_179",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting animata, managing the fields, running with my wings buzzing, and more.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_180",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERIZES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_181",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"knife screams it screams i cant breathe so scared help me please help\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_182",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"when it started, we could still hope The Man was gonna save us…\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_183",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Hey, Ted.  Alexander and Cass and I are heading to Z-Mobile for the last of the meth.  Keep the lizard fetus fed for us, OK?\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_184",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"i say we call the material from melting down cars 'massachusetite' or 'vermontsteel' or 'connecticut composite'\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_185",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Sometimes what you need when you're infected, bleeding, sick and hungover is a J and some chips.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_186",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't zombies, it's just camouflage!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_187",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_188",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I woke up with a dozen bears in a tribe outside the vault.  One was covered in red markings, glowing-- speaking.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_189",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"poor guy.  watched him from afar with my binocs for months and months.  today he died fighting.  feels like i knew him even though i never approached.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_190",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"ENGLAND DID THIS\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_191",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"That little fakkin rat din say anythin till we whacked him with a steel chain!  Then 'e just wanted to know if he could buy the chain!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_192",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"tom, adorned with fluid sacs three layers deep, crawls to safety like a slug\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_193",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"my friend turned fuckin insane and ate his arms and then his sister's arms!  he looked rather cross\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_194",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Starting today, the hallucinations are my only friends.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_195",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"For sale: zombaby shoes, very filthy\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_196",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Started my own brewery recently.  I just need some glass bottles, now!  Several thousand!  I'm planning way ahead.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_197",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing where those hordes are going.  Couldn't find the frequency, though.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_198",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Woah, bud!  Not all cannibals eat meat!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_199",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"ay why aint my bullets fuckin explodin\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_200",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Those Fiktok clan people picked this place clean… no food…\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_201",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The fewer people in New England, the stronger we'll become.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_202",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"It all boils down to the Apex Predator.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_204",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Got my mortar and pestle.  Now if I could just find some avocados…\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_205",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"saw a girl standing with the mushrooms.  spores coming out of slits in her neck.  she looked happy.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_206",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Found some pink berries.  Eating them makes bushes into more pink berries.  Infinite berry.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_207",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"m ust grow                 unity\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_208",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"AMY IS FUNGUS.  DO NOT LISTEN IF SHE ASKS YOU TO TAKE OFF MASK\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_209",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"my rabbi follows a new god now.  asks us to call him a local guide.  i dont mind, he keeps us fed\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_210",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Fungus are helping us.  Help them and they will unite us\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_211",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Saw a boy couldnt be older than 16.  Walked straight through the mushroom tower.  THROUGH IT\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_212",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Found some food in a box outside my house.  We ate it and now the fungaloids aren't harming us.  I think we are a mushroom now\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_213",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"saw the girl again.  she looked dead exhausted and walked right into the fungus.  30 mins later and she walked out good as new\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_214",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_215",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"mycus must grow\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_216",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"School bus with solar panels = TRUST.  Gave us berries and seeds, we were out of food\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_217",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"d o nThelp scho Ol buss makE seeeedS ARe FUNGUS!! !\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_218",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Go to every fungus patch you find but WEAR A SUIT.  Food there is very very filling.  Look for pink berries, blue flowers\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_219",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"red blue yellow berry seed sap bloom flowers tower mycus mycus mycus.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_220",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Husband 30 yrs died in bombs.  Mushrooms brought him back.  GIVE YOURSELF TO THEm AND THEY WILL HELP YOU\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_221",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Lisa always was a fan of sports.  Thank God these Global Athletics Games in Harran started some time before the outbreak, so she was able to leave New England before it was quarantined.  I can only hope there are no zombies, as we do have here, in the city she flew to.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_222",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Don't mix powders, them books said.  Do Not Mix powders.  Didn't listen did I.  Blew my goddamn pinky off, near lost my right eye.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_223",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"followed what toby wrote down.  shells looked like theyd hold more, I put in some more.  traded most to h raiders for crank.  shot my 38 today and it fuckn exploded.  low on crank, good as dead, no gun, no toby.  headed to montreal real sorry bout the bullets\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_224",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  wish I was smart enough to finagle that engine controller out of it… heard scrapper Joe put one in his deathmobile and now doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of shit…\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_225",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"⋯bioluminescent, 5' diameter⋯  appears to be an immense disembodied eyeball, capable of flight and [illegible] thought\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_226",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"What's the deal with boiling water?  Rain water is distilled naturally!  It's perfectly safe, you could save so much time if you didn't boil it.  I drunk some river water, and I'm fine!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_227",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Went to the emergency shelter, some guy walked in, walked out, grabbed a rock, smashed a bench to bits, carved a plank out of it, walked out again.  Haven't seen them in 3 days… wonder what their story is.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_228",
        text = ccb.content.text("This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"I know I have a fetish but THIS IS TOO MUCH.  My hands are made of slime.  My hair is slime.  My body is covered in slime.  I can't even use a crowbar 'cause of slime.  Wherever I go I leave a trail of slime.  Everything's slime.  My bag is falling off my back into slime.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_229",
        text = ccb.content.text("A page from a notebook, with a morse code reference and the following decoded message: \"Whiskey echo whiskey - Lima alpha delta\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_230",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"See if you want to be, extra annoying you can, nod off to the, dump and go, help, Erin to dig up the, last, peice\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_231",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw one of those Foodplace workers on the street.  Honestly, they look no different alive than dead.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_233",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I can imagine people sending their 'love and prayers' on social media.  Love doesn't kill zeds, prayer doesn't put food in my belly.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_234",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I used to take everything at face value.  If you couldn't measure it, couldn't explain it, couldn't put a number to it, it wasn't real.  Then this shit happened.  Real funny.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_235",
        text = ccb.content.text("This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"Blorble\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_236",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Saw some chick in the forest.  Her body is all green and shit, and she was covered in leaves and vines.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_237",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Good news: My teachers aren't trying to tear my limbs off about my homework.  Bad news: My teachers are trying to tear my limbs off regardless.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_238",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, I've stopped the bleeding, I'll be fine.  Can't stay here any longer, there's too much commotion outside.  Meet me back at our usual spot, we will retrieve our stuff together, don't go alone.  Be careful when exiting out the back, I saw one of them running around with a spear.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_239",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have realized I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_240",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, I hope you're finding my notes and the supply drops.  Use my binocs, if they're still there, and check out the roof.  Avoid the huge tower.  I don't know what's inside, but the noises that come out of it can't signal anything good.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_241",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Anyone reading this, stay off the roads.  Me and the boys were ambushed by some goons there.  If you see a fallen tree blocking your path, just turn around and go back.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_242",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Mike, we have your dog and that ginger fuck you run around with.  You know where to find us.  Come alone, it's time to pay up.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_243",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"5 gallons of water, 3 cans of chicken, 3 cans of soup, 14 9mm rounds.  GUNSHOP -> CHECK GARAGE -> CUT THROUGH YARDS -> HOME\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_244",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, don't head straight through, go around.  There's a glowing one just hanging out in the alley.  I tried stabbing it but it zapped me with some sort of static electricity and I ran back here.  I'll try to whack it with a club next time.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_245",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"STOP FOLLOWING ME I CAN HEAR YOU IN THE DARK\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_246",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, if you find this, I'm at the farm just out of town.  I'll need to stay there a few days, I've been wounded by one of those overgrown bastards, shot a spike right into my thigh.  I'll wait for you there as long as I can, stay safe.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_247",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, the city is full of them.  I don't know how, it's as if we never came through here.  They're the same ones we'd put down, I am sure of it.  They got back up and now look more dangerous than ever.  I saw one of them just snatch a bird right off the roof with its long hands.  You have to use the sewers.  I know we agreed not to travel underground, but as horrible as it is down there, I fear our world up here is no longer ours either.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_248",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, move only after dark.  I saw lights in the distance, I think there might be someone living around here.  Wish I had my radio right now.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_249",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, I have not found any of your notes, which means you're either taking a different path or have already made your way back home.  In the case you're still out here somewhere, if you see the sky suddenly grow dark, hide indoors immediately, I have a feeling this storm is far from over.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_250",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"2236\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_251",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, be careful around those bulging and pulsating corpses.  I saw one today.  I think there's something eating away at those things.  I didn't stick around to find out.  I burnt the entire building down, just to be sure, so you should have relatively safe passage.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_252",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, I ran into an actual human today!  He was looking for his daughter.  We exchanged some food and traded information on the surrounding area.  He spoke of a family living on a farm out in the fields, surviving and thriving!  Maybe it's time we carved ourselves a peaceful place in this hell.  We'll discuss this once we meet back home.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_253",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"G, there's something not right with the forests here.  The ground there feels soft and is overgrown with some sort of mushrooms.  Be careful not to breathe in the dust they kick up, I accidentally took a whiff and have been coughing and vomiting since.  The map shows there's a cabin just outside town, I'll lay low there until I feel better.  I'm almost home.  I know you will be waiting for me there.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_254",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a zombie covered in shrooms emitting some strange dust.  When another zombie got close, the two tore each other apart.  I'd rather not stay here anymore.  Im packing up my stuff soon.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_255",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I can see a large tower in the distance, And strange stalk-like creatures are around it.  I feel sick just looking at it, and fire hasn't solved it.  Those things seem to stay around it though.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_256",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"These berries are delicious!  Maybe taking these were worth it.  And the more I eat, the more of it appears!  it's like an infinite food cycle!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_257",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a corpse with strange berries shoved down their gullet, seems to have choked to death on the stuff.  greedy bastard\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_258",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Don't trust them.  The mushrooms aren't your friends.  They're delusional\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_259",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"trust me!  The mushrooms are your friends!  They brung her back!  they'll bring everybody back!\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_260",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"It's been weeks since I've seen anyone else.  The silence is deafening, almost as if the world is holding its breath.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_261",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Found an old photo of my family today.  God, I miss them.  If only I could turn back time.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_262",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Saw a group of them today, huddled around something.  When I got closer, I realized they were eating one of their own.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_263",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Started talking to myself more often.  It's scary how normal it feels now.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_264",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I tried to build a makeshift radio.  All I get is static and an occasional eerie whisper.  Maybe I'm going mad.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_265",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"If you're reading this, I'm heading to the old church.  It seems safer there.  The walls are thick, and I need some peace.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_266",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I heard a child laughing today.  It was just in my head.  Has to be.  There's no way a child could survive this.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_267",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The water smells strange.  Can't remember the last time I drank something that didn't taste like chemicals.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_268",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They found me.  I can hear them scratching at the door.  If anyone finds this, I'm sorry I couldn't make it.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_269",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Every night, I dream of the beach.  The sound of waves.  The smell of salt.  Waking up is the worst part.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_270",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"There are eyes in the dark.  Watching.  Waiting.  I can't stay here any longer.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_271",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"All the lights are out.  It's like the world is sleeping.  Or maybe it's dead.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_272",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a stash of old comic books.  For a few moments, I was a kid again.  Then reality set back in.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_273",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Met a guy today.  Said he's immune.  Bullshit, right?  No one is immune.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_274",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Ran out of ammo today.  Guess it's back to the good old-fashioned baseball bat.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_275",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"My watch stopped working.  Funny how something so small can make you feel completely lost.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_276",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"If you find this, head to the old mill on the outskirts.  There's a safe place there.  For now.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_277",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I think the government knew about this.  They were prepared.  We're just the collateral damage.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_278",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Saw a plane today.  Low and slow.  Could be a sign of hope, or just another trap.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_279",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Sometimes I forget what the world was like before.  It's like a distant memory, fading away.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_280",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"My hands are shaking so badly, I can barely write.  Not sure if it's fear or the cold.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_281",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Heard gunshots last night.  Not sure if that means someone survived or someone else died.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_282",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The nights are the worst.  That's when the voices come.  Whispering things I don't want to hear.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_283",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Why do the zombies avoid the old cemetery?  It's like something even they fear.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_284",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I miss hot showers.  Hell, I miss being clean.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_285",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"There's a weird fungus growing everywhere.  I'm starting to think it's not just a plant.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_286",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The sky looks different now.  Like it's always twilight.  The sun never fully rises.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_287",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"If I make it through this, I swear I'll never complain about anything ever again.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_288",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Saw a woman today, just standing there, staring at the sky.  She didn't even notice me.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_289",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found an old music box.  It still works.  Played it for a while, trying to remember happier times.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_290",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Why did this happen?  Who's to blame?  Was it us?\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_291",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Sometimes I think it would be easier to just give up.  But then I think of you, and I keep going.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_292",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They're evolving.  Saw one today that looked almost… not human.  God help us.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_293",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Found an old map.  Marked a few places I want to check out.  Maybe there's hope out there.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_294",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The smell of death is everywhere.  It's inescapable.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_295",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Met a trader today.  Bartered some ammo for food.  There's still a spark of humanity left.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_296",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a pack of wild dogs today.  They're surviving better than we are.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_297",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Got bit today.  Not sure how much time I have left.  Just wanted to say I love you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_298",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"If you find this, know that I tried my best.  I hope you fare better.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_299",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They say there's a safe zone in the north.  I don't know if it's true, but I have to try.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_300",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The wind howls through the empty streets, like the world itself is mourning.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_301",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They scream when they burn.  The sound haunts me.  But it's the only way to be sure.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_302",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Found a severed hand today.  It was clutching a note that read 'Kill me.'\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_303",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I can hear the whispers in my head.  They tell me to do things.  Horrible things.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_304",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The darkness is alive.  I swear I saw it move.  It's watching me.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_305",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I tried to cut it out, but it just keeps growing.  I can feel it under my skin, crawling.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_306",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The baby was stillborn.  We didn't bury it.  It got up and walked away.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_307",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I watched as they tore him apart, piece by piece.  He was still screaming when they started eating his guts.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_308",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Don't trust the shadows.  They move when you're not looking.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_309",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I can't sleep.  Every time I close my eyes, I see their faces.  The ones I couldn't save.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_310",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I thought I heard my mom calling me from the basement.  But she's been dead for years.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_311",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They don't just bite.  They infect you with something.  You start to rot from the inside out.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_312",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I keep hearing scratching in the walls.  Something's in there, trying to get out.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_313",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a pile of bones today.  They were arranged in a circle, like some kind of ritual.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_314",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"There's something wrong with the air.  It tastes… metallic.  Makes my head feel heavy.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_315",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw my reflection in the mirror, but it wasn't me.  It smiled and its eyes were black.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_316",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They don't just kill you.  They take over your body, use you like a puppet.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_317",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I woke up covered in blood.  I don't know whose blood it is.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_318",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The voices are getting louder.  They tell me to do unspeakable things.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_319",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a tooth embedded in my arm.  It wasn't mine.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_320",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Saw a man eating his own fingers today.  He didn't stop until he choked on the bones.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_321",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The ground outside my house is moving, like it's breathing.  I can't go out there.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_322",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I heard children laughing in the forest.  There are no children left.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_323",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Something's growing inside me.  I can feel it moving, shifting.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_324",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a woman gouging out her eyes.  Said she didn't want to see the monsters anymore.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_325",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Don't drink the water.  It makes you see things.  Terrible things.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_326",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They don't have faces anymore.  Just blank, smooth skin.  And they scream.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_327",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a room full of dolls.  Their eyes followed me as I moved.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_328",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Something's wrong with the sky.  It's… pulsating.  Like it's alive.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_329",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The flies are everywhere.  They whisper secrets in your ears.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_330",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a journal.  It describes rituals.  Dark, horrifying rituals.  I think they worked.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_331",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The birds are watching us.  They're not birds anymore.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_332",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Heard someone singing today.  Followed the sound, but there was no one there.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_333",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a man turn inside out.  His screams still echo in my ears.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_335",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a hand nailed to a tree.  It was pointing west.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_336",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The rain burns.  It's like acid.  My skin is covered in blisters.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_337",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Something crawled out of the sewer today.  It wasn't human.  It wasn't anything I've ever seen.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_338",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I watched my friend rot alive.  It started with his eyes, then his skin just peeled away.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_339",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a child's shoe.  It was filled with teeth.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_340",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The trees have faces now.  They whisper my name when I pass by.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_341",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a man dragging his entrails behind him.  He was still alive, begging for help.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_342",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Don't trust the light.  It draws you in, but it's a trap.  A trap set by them.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_343",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a cocoon.  Something inside was moving.  It looked almost… human.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_344",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a face in the fog.  It wasn't human.  It smiled at me.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_345",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The ground is covered in blood.  It's seeping up from below.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_346",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I hear them in the walls.  Scratching, clawing.  They're coming.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_347",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I found a mirror.  My reflection waved at me, but I didn't move.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_348",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"They've started to speak.  Their voices are garbled, but they're learning our language.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_349",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"I saw a man without a shadow today.  He looked right through me, like I wasn't there.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_350",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"The sun never sets anymore.  It just hangs there, glaring down at us.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_351",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my dearest Emily, if you're reading this, I want you to know that I never stopped looking for you.  Please be safe.  I love you more than anything.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_352",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Sarah, I'm so sorry I couldn't keep my promise.  I tried to get back, but they were everywhere.  I hope you made it to the shelter.  I love you, forever.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_353",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Mom, if you find this, know that I'm sorry.  I should've listened to you and stayed put.  I hope you're safe.  Love, your stubborn son.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_354",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear Lily, daddy's gone to find food.  I'll be back soon.  Be brave for me, princess.  I love you to the moon and back.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_355",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Anna, I found a safe place.  Follow the trail of red ribbons.  I'll be waiting for you.  I love you, always.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_356",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my beloved wife, I've gone to find help.  If I don't make it, please remember our happy times and stay strong.  All my love, always.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_357",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Michael, I heard there's a safe zone up north.  I'm heading there.  Please, if you're still alive, meet me there.  I can't do this without you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_358",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my little brother, I'm so sorry I wasn't there to protect you.  I hope you're with mom and dad now.  I miss you more than words can say.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_359",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Ellie, if you find this, I'm heading to the coast.  I pray you're safe and we'll be together soon.  I love you, now and always.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_360",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear John, I waited as long as I could.  Supplies are running low, and I need to move on.  Please find me.  I'll be leaving signs.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_361",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my sweet daughter, I left your favorite doll in the blue house on Elm Street.  I hope it gives you comfort.  Stay safe, my angel.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_362",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear Maria, I think of you every day.  I'm sorry for all the fights.  I'd give anything to see your smile again.  I love you, always.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_363",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Jake, if you find this, I'm sorry I couldn't be stronger.  Please forgive me and stay alive for both of us.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_364",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my darling wife, I'm sorry I couldn't protect our family.  I hope you and the kids are somewhere safe.  I love you all so much.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_365",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"My love, I've gone to find medicine.  I'll be back.  Hold on just a little longer.  I can't lose you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_366",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my brave little boy, daddy had to leave to find food.  Be strong and take care of mommy.  I love you more than anything.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_367",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Rachel, every night I dream of you.  I hope you're safe and we'll see each other again.  I miss you so much.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_368",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear Sam, I found a safe place.  Look for the red X on the old barn.  I'll be waiting for you.  Stay strong.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_369",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my beautiful wife, I don't know if I'll make it back.  But please know that you and the kids were my everything.  I love you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_370",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"My dear Emma, I left a map in the old treehouse.  Follow it to find me.  I'm sorry I couldn't be there to protect you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_371",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my beloved family, I tried my best to keep us all together.  If you find this, please remember me and take care of each other.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_372",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dad, I'm heading to the city to find help.  Please be safe and wait for me. I love you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_373",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear Laura, the world is a nightmare now, but I hold onto the hope that you're safe.  I love you more than life itself.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_374",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Mom, I'm so sorry I left.  I thought I could find food.  Please forgive me and stay safe.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_375",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my sweet son, I've hidden some supplies in the attic.  Be brave and remember I love you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_376",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Jessica, if you're reading this, I made it to the old cabin.  It's safe here.  Please come find me.  I need you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_377",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my loving husband, I'm sorry I couldn't hold on longer.  I hope you find peace and remember our love.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_378",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Mom, dad, I'm heading to the farm.  If you're out there, meet me there.  I miss you both so much.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_379",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my little sister, I left you a teddy bear in the bunker.  Hold onto it and know I'm always with you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_380",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear Mark, I've gone to look for a way out.  If you find this, know that I love you and will always be with you in spirit.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_381",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Sarah, I think of you every day.  I hope you're alive and we'll find each other again.  I love you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_382",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my dear wife, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.  Please forgive me.  I love you eternally.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_383",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my brave daughter, if you find this, know that daddy loves you and is always with you, even if you can't see me.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_384",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Anna, I found shelter in the old mill.  It's safe here.  Please come find me.  I need you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_385",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my darling son, I've left you all the supplies I could gather.  Be strong and know that I love you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_386",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"My dearest Emily, I'm sorry I couldn't be there to protect you.  I hope you're somewhere safe.  I love you so much.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_387",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my sweet wife, I tried to find help but I'm running out of time.  Please stay strong.  I love you always.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_388",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Mom, I'm sorry for everything.  I hope you're safe.  I love you more than words can say.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_389",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"Dear John, I found a place to hide.  It's safe for now.  Please come find me.  I miss you.\""),
    }
    category:entry {
        id = "note_390",
        text = ccb.content.text("\"To my beloved daughter, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.  I love you with all my heart.  Stay strong.\""),
    }
    ccb.content.add(category)
end

do
